---
import Layout from '@layouts/Common.astro'
import {Icon} from 'astro-icon/components'

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  return [{params: {slug: 'the-real-cost-of-ignoring-technical-seo'}}]
}

const {slug} = Astro.params
---

<Layout>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="format split-1 py-copy relative flex min-h-[400px] items-center justify-center">
    <div class="item relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
      <p class="text-primary inline-block rounded-full bg-black/30 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-semibold">
        Technical SEO
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-extrabold text-white">The real cost of ignoring technical SEO</h1>
      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
        <img
          src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image.svg"
          alt="James Rodriguez"
          class="size-12 rounded-full border-2 border-white"
        />
        <div class="text-left text-white">
          <p class="font-semibold">James Rodriguez</p>
          <p class="text-xs">15 Jan 2025 • 7 min read</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img
        src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image.svg"
        alt="Blog background"
        class="size-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/60"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <section class="format split-1 py-copy">
    <div class="prose mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-4">
        <nav class="text-sm">
          <a href="/blog" class="text-primary hover:underline">Blog</a> / <span>Technical SEO</span>
        </nav>
        <div class="text-primary flex gap-2">
          <a href="#"><Icon name="mdi:facebook" class="size-5" /></a>
          <a href="#"><Icon name="mdi:linkedin" class="size-5" /></a>
          <a href="#"><Icon name="mdi:twitter" class="size-5" /></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg font-semibold">
        Mi tincidunt elit, id quisque ligula ac diam, amet. Vel etiam suspendisse morbi eleifend
        faucibus eget vestibulum felis. Dictum quis montes, sit sit.
      </p>

      <p>
        Tellus aliquam enim urna, etiam. Mauris posuere vulputate arcu amet, vitae nisi, tellus
        tincidunt. At feugiat sapien varius id.
      </p>

      <img
        src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image-landscape.svg"
        alt="Technical SEO concept"
        class="my-8 w-full rounded"
      />

      <blockquote>
        "Ipsum sit mattis nulla quam nulla. Gravida id gravida ac enim mauris id. Non pellentesque
        congue eget consectetur turpis."
      </blockquote>

      <p>
        Morbi sed imperdiet in ipsum, adipiscing elit dui lectus. Tellus id scelerisque est
        ultricies ultricies. Duis est sit sed leo nisl, blandit elit sagittis.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-t pt-6">
        <span class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold">Technical SEO</span>
        <span class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold">Site Speed</span>
        <span class="rounded bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold">Core Web Vitals</span>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 flex items-center gap-6 rounded bg-gray-50 p-6">
        <img
          src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image.svg"
          alt="James Rodriguez"
          class="size-16 rounded-full"
        />
        <div>
          <p class="font-bold">James Rodriguez</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
            Technical SEO Lead at Onio Insights. Helping websites load faster and rank higher since
            2015.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="format split-1 py-copy">
    <div class="mx-auto w-lg text-center">
      <h2>Ready to dominate search</h2>
      <button class="bg-primary mt-6 rounded px-6 py-3 text-white">Free Audit</button>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
